hrought artificial intelligence and learn from everyone you know.", "short_description": "TWINCREATOR VR is the prototype from which you can test your artificial intelligences coming to life"}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "179112094901097", "locale": "it_IT", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "TWINCREATOR VR", "keywords": [], "long_description": "TWINCREATOR VR \u00e8 un mondo virtuale in cui puoi trovare assistenti personali creati dall'uomo per esporre personaggi storici, persone reali, tutto ci\u00f2 che pu\u00f2 assumere un'identit\u00e0.\nIn TwinCreator e MemoryTwin puoi creare il tuo progetto gemello business (app.twincreator.com) o consumer (app.memorytwin.com), e poi incontrarlo in questo mondo virtuale.\nPuoi parlare con loro, vedere i loro ricordi, condividere le tue conoscenze attraverso l'intelligenza artificiale e imparare da tutti quelli che conosci.", "short_description": "TWINCREATOR VR \u00e8 il prototipo da cui puoi testare le tue intelligenze artificiali che prendono vita"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://app.twincreator.com/api/privacy_vr?lang=en", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "AppLab", "support_website_url": "https://form.asana.com/?k=XC7S3JWQeIhnjipBuA3gbw&d=1199599736247413", "website_url": "https://twincreator.com/", "category": "ENTERTAINMENT", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1063584910766706"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["RELAXATION_MEDITATION"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "it"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supp